{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"上半屏左侧的大号白色正文，首先落在开头第一行“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近”，字号最大、亮度最高，视觉入口明确。右上角绿色高亮的阶段目录是次级入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个明知回去未必能找回从前的亲近，却仍然忍不住想回去的人。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、犹豫，带着一点侥幸期待。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他最终决定先把眼下日子过稳；即使仍然害怕、心里没底，也不打算收回向前走的决定。尤其是“害怕还在，脚却已经往前走了”这一核心关系，第一眼不容易拿到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块正文太长，一块里包含回头的念想、现实考量、恐惧、行动决心以及音乐表现等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心关系出现在正文后半段，开头突出的是留恋和回头的念想，结尾才揭示害怕仍在却继续向前，需要读过较长一段才能理解人物此刻的真正状态。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "33523e9b-ade3-4ddd-808f-05d38edfa17a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T015527989015Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.563, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:56:01.550846+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d7a8a676c8bc1535d690e045584406479f0167b2bd02d9f02a62cb230f15e876", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42